## Pull request overview

This PR reduces background overhead/noise from Kea Devtools by ensuring the devtools panel (and action-collection instrumentation) only runs when the panel is open *and* the page is visible, improving the signal in memory/heap investigations.

**Changes:**
- Added page visibility tracking and used it to gate rendering of the devtools panel.
- Stopped attaching window drag/resize listeners unless the panel is actually rendered.
- Limited Redux dispatch patching/action collection to when the panel is rendered and the “actions” tab is active, with safer unpatch cleanup.


